doing what we can to jump start support for this&nbsp;
program as we build into the 2024 election. If&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:49.740 --> 00:05:54.180
you've been saying maybe I'll get one of those&nbsp;
memberships. I don't know, David. I kind of like&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:54.180 --> 00:05:59.820
the show, but I don't like you enough to pay&nbsp;
full price. Fair. Fair. Monday morning will be&nbsp;&nbsp;

